# the same program with typed operations withheld: the operator stays as it is written, whatever Link has proven of its sides
# RUN: walk f7 mechanisms=none+DirectCalls+Arrivals
# CHECK-LABEL: code f7:Body
# CHECK: = InstanceOf
# RUN(NEVER): walk f4 f5 f6 f7 f8 mechanisms=none+DirectCalls+Arrivals+Folding
# NEVER-NOT: ShapeTest
# NEVER-NOT: HasInPrototypeChain
# NEVER-NOT: GetClassPrototype
# with folding withheld no answer is a constant: a Twig is asked for its shape no more, and its chain is walked
# RUN(UNFOLDED): walk f5 mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+DirectCalls+Arrivals
# UNFOLDED-LABEL: code f5:Body
# UNFOLDED-NOT: boolean=true
# UNFOLDED: = HasInPrototypeChain
# PROGRAM-OF: instance-of-a-class-asks-for-the-shape.ir
